// MegaDreifach v2 (current). The rules are primitives/hash/megadreifach/SPEC.md.
// A toy three-megaminx Merkle-Damgard hash. Not for real use.
// Product name MegaDreifach is locked. The puzzle/group is megaminx.
// v2 changes only E_m (visual noon, early alternating read, 36 F3 rounds); v1 is deprecated, frozen at v1/.
// A sudocode int is 64-bit and overflow traps; |G| and 52! need pasted bigint.
// Tests lock pad, φ, IV-COOK12, rank, the group law, the public API, the edge
// table, the visual noon, and the v2 KATs (kats/megaminx_hash_kats_v2.json).

